ed": false, "text": "requireAuth + requireMfaIfEnrolled\nlistOrgsBlockingAccountDeletion:\n  satu-satunya OWNER organisasi tim yang\n  masih punya anggota/konten → 409\n  org_successor_required (+ daftar org);\n  user harus menunjuk pengganti dulu", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "requireAuth + requireMfaIfEnrolled\nlistOrgsBlockingAccountDeletion:\n  satu-satunya OWNER organisasi tim yang\n  masih punya anggota/konten → 409\n  org_successor_required (+ daftar org);\n  user harus menunjuk pengganti dulu", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "eac14e2171b94988b652", "type": "rectangle", "x": 640, "y": 320, "width": 560, "height": 204.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["e1d15659cbc14d42bdf5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 406805154, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2107458799, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "44631800e1764abfaca0", "type": "arrow"}, {"id": "92e3c5463e0c4e87ab87", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a7bc1ba3c1c546da80b5", "type": "text", "x": 654, "y": 334, "width": 283.5, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["e1d15659cbc14d42bdf5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 249014170, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1851523343, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "2 · RPC request_account_deletion", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "2 · RPC request_account_deletion", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "5fc019fcd80b4a33a335", "type": "text", "x": 654, "y": 364.5, "width": 286.6, "height": 146.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["e1d15659cbc14d42bdf5"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 546641551, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 695563847, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "SATU transaksi atomik:\n • kunci user_profiles\n • prepare_account_org_departures\n   (serah-terima / arsip konten org)\n • antre job account.delete\n   dedupe 'account.delete:<user>', 20 percobaan\n • set account_deletion_requested_at\nSetelah ini auth menolak: 401\n  account_deletion_pending", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "SATU transaksi atomik:\n • kunci user_profiles\n • prepare_account_org_departures\n   (serah-terima / arsip konten org)\n • antre job account.delete\n   dedupe 'account.delete:<user>', 20 percobaan\n • set account_deletion_requested_at\nSetelah ini auth menolak: 401\n  account_deletion_pending", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "3c224f7a5bb345bda5dd", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1260, "y": 320, "width": 760, "height": 204.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2aa38f24adb341c1bfcc"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1503791693, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 320532455, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [{"id": "92e3c5463e0c4e87ab87", "type": "arrow"}], "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "09947c6f84274d909a14", "type": "text", "x": 1274, "y": 334, "width": 376.3, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e03131", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2aa38f24adb341c1bfcc"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 399461763, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1644550744, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "3 · Job account.delete (handleAccountDelete)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "3 · Job account.delete (handleAccountDelete)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "1f36132edbd949aa8d9d", "type": "text", "x": 1274, "y": 364.5, "width": 383.1, "height": 146.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["2aa38f24adb341c1bfcc"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 166423969, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1478348738, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Cek blocker LAGI (org bisa berubah sejak request) →\n  NonRetryableJobError: gagal langsung & terbaca,\n  SEBELUM ada yang dihapus\ndeleteUserAccountData (urutan di bawah)\nhapus artefak ekspor di storage (gagal = job gagal,\n  jangan hilangkan penunjuk dulu)\nbersihkan antrean: db_jobs bermuatan userId,\n  memory.consolidate oleh user; segarkan status memory proyek\nauth.admin.deleteUser TERAKHIR ('not found' = sukses)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Cek blocker LAGI (org bisa berubah sejak request) →\n  NonRetryableJobError: gagal langsung & terbaca,\n  SEBELUM ada yang dihapus\ndeleteUserAccountData (urutan di bawah)\nhapus artefak ekspor di storage (gagal = job gagal,\n  jangan hilangkan penunjuk dulu)\nbersihkan antrean: db_jobs bermuatan userId,\n  memory.consolidate oleh user; segarkan status memory proyek\nauth.admin.deleteUser TERAKHIR ('not found' = sukses)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "e5d88ddd7c724368b206", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 560, "width": 2340, "height": 287.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["625c96e294dc4089b180"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 42960327, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 145587941, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "a8e0599ceb614fce8931", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 574, "width": 270.8, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["625c96e294dc4089b180"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 972210976, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2118641697, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Urutan deleteUserAccountData", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Urutan deleteUserAccountData", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "775bad0292a641ee8f17", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 605.8, "width": 859.3, "height": 227.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["625c96e294dc4089b180"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 264198070, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 926397434, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "0  tolak bila masih jadi satu-satunya owner org (sebelum menyentuh apa pun)\n1  prepare_account_org_departures (aman diulang) · hapus KONTEN org personal\n2  partisi proyek: personal vs org yang dibuat user vs org yang berisi kontribusinya\n3  kumpulkan id dokumen yang akan dihapus; tangkap path storage (mode tanpa worker)\n4  cabut grant akses & undangan konten atas email user · hapus artefak ekspor\n5  konten org: DILEPAS (user_id→null / serah ke org) agar proyek org tetap hidup; playbook org diserahkan\n6  hapus dokumen · kosongkan atribusi folder · hapus chat, review tabular + chat, word_documents, workflow,\n   submission/share workflow, quick_actions, instalasi workflow default · audit PERSONAL dihapus,\n   audit org dianonimkan (user_id/email → null)\n7  hapus playbook user · wipe_memory_file (epoch naik: curator yang masih jalan tak bisa menulis balik)\n8  hapus proyek personal (deleteProjectsByIds: fence chat + purge memory)\n9  storage: byte baru dihapus SETELAH semua baris hilang (gagal di tengah = byte yatim, bukan akun hidup\n   dengan dokumen 404) → deleteOrphanedUserStorage menyapu yatim\n10 deleteUserOrganizations: batalkan undangan, sisa keanggotaan", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "0  tolak bila masih jadi satu-satunya owner org (sebelum menyentuh apa pun)\n1  prepare_account_org_departures (aman diulang) · hapus KONTEN org personal\n2  partisi proyek: personal vs org yang dibuat user vs org yang berisi kontribusinya\n3  kumpulkan id dokumen yang akan dihapus; tangkap path storage (mode tanpa worker)\n4  cabut grant akses & undangan konten atas email user · hapus artefak ekspor\n5  konten org: DILEPAS (user_id→null / serah ke org) agar proyek org tetap hidup; playbook org diserahkan\n6  hapus dokumen · kosongkan atribusi folder · hapus chat, review tabular + chat, word_documents, workflow,\n   submission/share workflow, quick_actions, instalasi workflow default · audit PERSONAL dihapus,\n   audit org dianonimkan (user_id/email → null)\n7  hapus playbook user · wipe_memory_file (epoch naik: curator yang masih jalan tak bisa menulis balik)\n8  hapus proyek personal (deleteProjectsByIds: fence chat + purge memory)\n9  storage: byte baru dihapus SETELAH semua baris hilang (gagal di tengah = byte yatim, bukan akun hidup\n   dengan dokumen 404) → deleteOrphanedUserStorage menyapu yatim\n10 deleteUserOrganizations: batalkan undangan, sisa keanggotaan", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "6a64b8f5176e4cc4bbdd", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 900, "width": 2340, "height": 93.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["30b169d5e5d9416fb3b7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1159451183, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1062518256, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "870e615c25f84cc292b0", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 914, "width": 388.1, "height": 22.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["30b169d5e5d9416fb3b7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 965260012, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 646058684, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419176670, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tanpa runner job (DB_JOBS_ENABLED=false)", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tanpa runner job (DB_JOBS_ENABLED=false)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "06c8510bac524594b6b6", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 944.5, "width": 935.9, "height": 35.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["30b169d5e5d9416fb3b7"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 713382056, "version": 1, "v